 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/071018.jpg\" alt=\"minelab coil small\" title=\"minelab equinox small coil \" width=\"623\" height=\"349\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "Metal Detecting lincolnshire UK,"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "with the <a href=\"@minelab-equinox/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Minelab Equinox 800</a> Stock Coil and small Coil."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Cold Day today started off detecting just after 9am with the stock coil on a stubble field, using field mode 2. finding plenty of buttons and small pieces of lead, by lunchtime not one coin so heading back to the car"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "i pick up a signal and blow me down a Roman Coin."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Now as i dont generally metal detect on land this was only the 2nd Roman coin i have found this year."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "If you have any tips for this beach detectorist please feel free to leave a comment.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "make sure you have <a href=\"@social-sites/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Subscribed on YOUTUBE</a> to follow our adventures"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Intrested in the Minelab Equinox and Coils that are available please give <a href=\"@crawfords-metal-detectors/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Crawfords Metal Detecting</a> a visit"
  }
 ],
